  "notes": [
    "TEST only. Loops at 12/30 and 18/30, max 600 seconds, five slots with two-second respawns, independent 5% elite chance and uniform ordinary selection. Boss at 18/30, max 120 seconds, one boss and no summons.",
    "B1 with no regen affixes, purple/chapter-three gear or potions; one 2% kill-heal affix replaces the existing basic-damage affix. Warrior target weight 3; other jobs 1. Existing AI unchanged.",
    "Sacrifice replaces a priest attack action when cooldown is ready. Only other currently living enemies gain +6 DR percentage points for five seconds, nonstacking. Self-loss cannot kill and is excluded from player DPS and kills.",
    "Stone shell counts positive direct hit damage including companion/direct skill hits; partial parry with positive damage counts, zero-damage miss does not. DOT never increments the shell counter.",
    "Rune and forbidden damage debuffs multiply with each other and facility outgoing multiplier. They do not change healing, defense or speed. DOT uses the owner's current debuff on each tick, with its initial rune/forbidden factor removed from the stored DOT base.",
    "Blood DR coverage is run-time fraction with at least one living enemy buffed; rune coverage is run-time fraction with at least one living player affected, not every player affected.",
    "Trigger rates for ordinary/elite passives divide by all spawns, including late or uncompleted enemies. Enemy damage shares exclude environmental damage and do not reattribute indirect support effects."
  ]
